More from Charlie Munger
Charlie Munger wasn't active on social media, he didn't write any books, and he rarely
made media appearances.
The best regular opportunity to hear from Munger came during the annual meeting for
Berkshire Hathaway's shareholders, during which he and Buffett elded questions from
the audience.
Additionally, his long-term friend Peter Kaufman compiled many of Munger's thoughts
and sayings into a book calledPoor Charlie's Almanack: The Wit and Wisdom of
Charles T. Munger. While not authored by Munger himself, the book does provide more
insight into his way of thinking.
